<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Medex falls to half yr pre-exceps shr loss.</title>
<headline>Medex falls to half yr pre-exceps shr loss.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Oct 31, 1996 (million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - pre-exceps	    2.1 loss    vs 8.6 profit</p>
<p>    - post exceps	   2.5 profit  vs 8.6 profit</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   1.76	  vs 5.82</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   3.34	  vs 6.48</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.29	  vs 1.36</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   0.46	  vs 0.72</p>
<p>    Turnover		  53.70	 vs 55.28</p>
<p>Full name: Medex Ltd</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     3.253 gain  vs none</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said no dividend was declared. The exceptional gain represents compensation received in respect of rationalisation costs.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
